o), Append-organization-level-legs-are-NULL (the polymorphic-FK shape probe), Append-caller-supplied-id-preserved, Append-duplicate-id-Conflict (PK), Append-validation-matrix (10 sub-cases covering missing + unknown taxonomy + zero timestamps + premature resolution), Append-nil-Tx-Internal, Append-unknown-organization-Conflict (FK), Append-cross-tenant-parent-Conflict (3 sub-cases: foreign project / environment / service via composite-FK), Append-rollback-removes-row, Append-peer-row-byte-identical, GetByID-round-trip, GetByID-unknown-NotFound, GetByID-cross-tenant-NotFound, List-orders-newest-first (detected_at DESC + id DESC tiebreaker), List-clamps-limit (4 sub-cases), List-unknown-org-empty-slice-not-nil, MarkResolved-happy-path (resolved_at + actor + UpdatedAt-after-CreatedAt + raw-SQL byte-equal), MarkResolved-already-resolved-Conflict + no-overwrite (the load-bearing state-transition pin), MarkResolved-unknown-NotFound, MarkResolved-cross-tenant-NotFound + bystander-byte-identity, MarkResolved-validation-matrix (4 sub-cases), MarkResolved-nil-Tx-Internal, MarkResolved-peer-row-byte-identical, Cascade-delete-from-organization. New helpers introduced (per-file DriftFinding-suffix to avoid store_test collisions): rawDriftFindingRow (with *string + *time.Time fields for the nullable legs + resolved_at), loadDriftFindingRowByID, countDriftFindingRowsForOrg, mintDriftFindingID + sanitizeTestNameForDriftID, driftFindingTxRollbackSentinel, driftFindingFixture, seedDriftFinding, assertDriftFindingByteIdentical, assertStringPtrEqual, assertTimePtrEqual. Reused verbatim from sibling files: seedOrg, seedProject, seedEnvironment, seedService (schema_test.go); newStore (store_test.go); wantErrCode (idempotency_test.go). NEW migration added: 0037_drift_findings.up.sql + .down.sql, both with the standard DROP TRIGGER / DROP INDEX / DROP TABLE shape; the up.sql includes a service_domains composite FK so service_domains must remain a composite-FK target — a future migration th