@@ -34642,3 +34643,14 @@ change that widened Reason to caller-supplied data.
   - Adding a lifecycle state to an existing table can remain backward-compatible by adding a `NOT NULL DEFAULT` status column and keeping the public HTTP projection unchanged unless the PRD story explicitly changes the API contract.
   - State-machine event tables should mirror the deployment/job pattern: append-only table, composite `(organization_id, resource_id)` FK, oldest-first list query, and redacted free-text reason stored in both message and metadata.
